      "side": "Anglo-Portuguese",
      "summary": "Thrown in to support the Spanish on the hill. Colborne's brigade, caught in line by the Vistula lancers and hussars in a squall, lost three of its four battalions; Hoghton's and Abercrombie's then stood and traded volleys with the French columns at close range.",
